1
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:40,039
Brother.

2
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:41,520
What should we do?

3
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:46,490
You were the one who asked Mala out.

4
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:51,050
He was beaten so badly he wanted to die.

5
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,800
Then Mala disappeared.

6
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:57,120
Mala just disappeared like that.

7
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:03,210
Actually, there's something I haven't told you.

8
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,400
It was me.

9
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,960
I was the one who told Tie Nan and the others

10
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:10,360
that Mala is a famous sci-fi writer online.

11
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,600
Maybe that's the real reason

12
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:15,200
they kept harassing Mala.

13
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:16,880
It's all my fault.

14
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,680
I didn't expect my showing off would get Mala killed.

15
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,520
I'm sorry.

16
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,160
But I don't know.

17
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,880
I'm sorry.

18
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,520
Xiaotao.

19
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,200
It's not your fault.

20
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,640
It's the abusers.

21
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,240
It's them.

22
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,160
Do you remember?

23
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,280
I wrote the manuscript for 'The Death of Marat' first.

24
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,960
I gave it to you.

25
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,280
That's why you have your success today.

26
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:55,400
And why you have the chance to be nominated for the Galaxy Award today.

27
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:58,040
You said you'd take me with you when you made it.

28
00:02:58,760 --> 00:02:59,960
But what happened?

29
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,000
You're now just like those people

30
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,000
we used to hate the most.

31
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,000
Like those who burn bridges,

32
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,960
those who kiss up and kick down.

33
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:13,120
You never treated me as a brother.

34
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,260
I can share the money with you.

35
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,120
I can share opportunities with you.

36
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,880
'The Death of Marat'

37
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:28,480
was written by me, word for word, with my blood and sweat.

38
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,740
Why should I give you a co-author credit?

39
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,130
I earned this success with so much effort.

40
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:36,650
And you just want to take it away so easily.

41
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:37,880
Xiaotao.

42
00:03:38,079 --> 00:03:39,480
I don't owe you anything.

43
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:42,540
You don't owe me anything.

44
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,600
Whatever.

45
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:47,460
After twelve o'clock,

46
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,760
when you're dead,

47
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:51,120
I'll tell everyone what you've done,

48
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:53,960
including how you killed Marat back then.

49
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,760
It's ridiculous.

50
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:01,920
I'm so ridiculous.

51
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,080
I took the blame for someone like you

52
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,600
for ten years.

53
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,840
I was deceived by you for so long,

54
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,240
and treated like a fool for ten years.

55
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,040
Who told you this?

56
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,040
Who told you?

57
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,680
Li Zhiwei.

58
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,800
You're feeling guilty.

59
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,280
You're afraid that the ugly things you've done over the years

60
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,400
will be discovered.

61
00:04:45,760 --> 00:04:47,720
Take a good look at yourself now.

62
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:48,720
When the time comes,

63
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:51,240
I'll let everyone see your true colors.

64
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:55,640
Xiaotao.

65
00:04:56,720 --> 00:05:00,360
Don't try to blame your failures on others.

66
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,200
You seem honest and diligent,

67
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,660
but you're actually cowardly

68
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,040
and weak.

69
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,920
You don't have the talent

70
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:13,400
or the perseverance to write 'The Death of Marat'.

71
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,520
It's the same with An'an.

72
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:16,520
You like her but you can't do anything,

73
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,380
and you don't dare to do anything.

74
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:21,400
When others succeed and get what they want,

75
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,600
you want a piece of the pie.

76
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,640
Why should you?

77
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,760
Li Zhiwei.

78
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,600
Do you dare to say you really didn't draw

79
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,920
any inspiration from my novel?

80
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:37,159
I haven't sacrificed any less than you.

81
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:42,480
I've also put in a lot of effort over the years.

82
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,720
Sometimes I wonder

83
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,159
if I was wrong.

84
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:52,320
Did I make the wrong choice from the very beginning?

85
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,520
Why have I put in so much effort over the years

86
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,200
only to get nothing in the end?

87
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,600
I got nothing.

88
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,360
I got absolutely nothing.

89
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,120
Xiaotao.

90
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:10,860
I thought you were like me.

91
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,280
We've seen the world

92
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,600
and have such big dreams,

93
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,720
yet we're just small-town youths from humble beginnings.

94
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,320
We put in so much effort

95
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:21,440
but can only be ordinary people.

96
00:06:24,320 --> 00:06:26,520
Even if the result is like this, so what?

97
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,320
Should we just stop trying?

98
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,320
Should we just do nothing?

99
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,840
I always thought

100
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:35,520
you understood me best,

101
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,920
you knew best,

102
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,159
and you could understand all this best.

103
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,140
I wish you success.

104
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:58,960
Xiaotao.

105
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,240
Wait for me.

106
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:07,840
We can still try again.

107
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:09,000
We can start over.

108
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,680
Wait for me.

109
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:39,040
Li Zhiwei.

110
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,840
Everything is destined.

111
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:44,380
It's useless to struggle and resist.

112
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,200
Are you just like Xiaotao,

113
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:48,409
thinking I'm good for nothing?

114
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,360
I'm different from you.
